#: data/maps/FortreeCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:30
msgctxt "FortreeCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GoToSafariZone"
msgid ""
"Listen, kid, are you working\n"
"on a POKéDEX?\p"
"Hmm… Go to the SAFARI ZONE.\n"
"That's my suggestion.$"
msgstr ""
"我说，小家伙，你在完成宝可梦图鉴吗？\p"
"嗯……去狩猎地带吧。这是我的建议。$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:36
msgctxt "FortreeCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_RecordCornerIsNeat"
msgid ""
"Have you done anything at\n"
"the RECORD CORNER?\p"
"It's pretty neat. It mixes and matches\n"
"the records of TRAINERS.\p"
"I don't know quite how it works,\n"
"but it's cool. It's exciting, even!$"
msgstr ""
"你在记录角玩过吗？\p"
"那里挺有意思的，\n"
"可以把训练家们的记录混合交换。\p"
"我也不太清楚是怎么做到的，\n"
"但真的很酷，甚至让人很兴奋呢！$"

#: data/maps/FortreeCity_PokemonCenter_1F/scripts.inc:44
msgctxt "FortreeCity_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_DoYouKnowAboutPokenav"
msgid ""
"Oh, wow, you have a POKéNAV!\n"
"And it's just like mine!\p"
"Do you know about POKéNAV's\n"
"MATCH CALL system?\p"
"Access it, and you can chat with\n"
"registered TRAINERS anytime.\p"
"It also shows you which TRAINERS\n"
"want a rematch with you.\p"
"It's really nifty! Those DEVON guys\n"
"sure know what they're doing!$"
msgstr ""
"哇，你有宝可梦导航！\n"
"而且和我的一模一样！\p"
"你知道宝可梦导航的对战呼叫功能吗？\p"
"只要打开它，\n"
"随时都能和登记过的训练家聊天。\p"
"它还会显示哪些训练家想和你再战一场。\p"
"真是太方便了！\n"
"得文公司的人果然很有一套！$"
